    "sub_name": "民事訴訟法(一)",
    "sub_ename": " CODE OF CIVIL PROCEDURE（I）",
    "describe_ch": "民事訴訟法簡而言之即為民事案件於法院中尋求解決之程序規則。主要內容包括：訴訟主體、第一審程序、上訴審程序、抗告程序、再審程序、保全程序、公示催告程序等。",
    "describe_eh": "Civil Procedure are rules that guide a civil case through the court system. The content of this course including the following: standing, trial procedure, appeal procedure, objection proceeding, reexamination proceeding, securing proceeding and notice proceeding.",
